<LegalLayout locale="en" title="Security" description="How DoctorConverter protects your documents: encrypted transfer, isolated processing, session-only access and automatic deletion.">
  <p>Your documents are often personal: resumes, passports, contracts, bank statements. Here is how we protect them.</p>
  <h2>1. Encrypted transfer</h2>
  <p>Files travel between your browser and our servers over HTTPS (TLS).</p>
  <h2>2. Session-only access</h2>
  <p>Every upload is tied to an anonymous, signed session. Other visitors cannot see, download or delete your files or jobs.</p>
  <h2>3. Controlled processing</h2>
  <p>Documents are processed by fixed, resource-limited conversion engines with strict file checks. Macros, embedded binaries and external links in Office files are rejected, and password-protected or malformed files are refused.</p>
  <h2>4. Automatic deletion</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Files and results expire automatically after the retention period.</li>
    <li>“Delete files” closes access immediately; physical deletion completes in the background shortly after.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>5. Reporting</h2>
  <p>Found a security issue? Contact <a href="mailto:destek@doctorconverter.com" class="text-accent underline font-medium">destek@doctorconverter.com</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
